<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3570] User search is not working in zeppelin with LdapRealm</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3570</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;User search is not working in zeppelin with LdapRealm.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce :&lt;br/&gt;
1) Configure shiro.ini as below :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
[main]
ldapRealm = org.apache.zeppelin.realm.LdapRealm
ldapRealm.userDnTemplate = cn={0},ou=Users,dc=company,dc=com
ldapRealm.contextFactory.url = ldap:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//&amp;lt;ldap-server-host&amp;gt;:389
&lt;/span&gt;ldapRealm.contextFactory.authenticationMechanism = SIMPLE
ldapRealm.contextFactory.systemUsername = cn=hrt_1,ou=Users,dc=company,dc=com
ldapRealm.hadoopSecurityCredentialPath = jceks:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//hdfs/user/zeppelin/conf/zeppelin.jceks
&lt;/span&gt;ldapRealm.searchBase = dc=company,dc=com
ldapRealm.userSearchBase = dc=company,dc=com
ldapRealm.groupSearchBase = dc=company,dc=com
ldapRealm.userSearchAttributeName = uid

sessionManager = org.apache.shiro.web.session.mgt.DefaultWebSessionManager
securityManager.sessionManager = $sessionManager
securityManager.sessionManager.globalSessionTimeout = 86400000
shiro.loginUrl = /api/login
[urls]
/api/version = anon
/** = authc
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) Now login to zeppelin and try to assign user for a notebook. Here while searching for user, partial search is not working&lt;/p&gt;</description>
